{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54203","headline":"和濮阳人登眺江亭赋长韵（题拟） · 崔渥","name":"和濮阳人登眺江亭赋长韵（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲步江亭驻客行，殿台高敞杜鹃声。\n风生屈宋魂应散，雨过黄娥恨亦轻。\n春笋乱穿阶藓缺，晚霞旁衬野花明。\n翠华不返蒲关去，鸳鹭数行松韵清。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔渥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}